1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,329
But the number that redefined the group came in January 2025.

2
00:00:04,329 --> 00:00:14,407
On the 25th, the Hello Monsters world tour opened at Seoul's K-S-P-O Dome — the Olympic gymnastics arena that functions as K-pop's certification board.

3
00:00:14,407 --> 00:00:19,046
Fastest female act ever to headline it: eight months after debut.

4
00:00:19,046 --> 00:00:23,724
Three hundred thousand tickets across thirty-two shows in twenty cities followed.

